<Page title="Privacy — Fettle, London" description="We keep as little as we need to do good work, and we don&rsquo;t sell it on. Here&rsquo;s the plain version.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p class="lede">We keep as little as we need to do good work, and we don&rsquo;t sell it on. Here&rsquo;s the plain version.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="muted">Last updated 2 July 2026.</p>

          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <p>When you check availability or get in touch, we take your postcode, your name, and a way to reach you &mdash; phone, WhatsApp, or email. When we visit, we note what needs doing at your home so we can price and plan the work.</p>

          <h2>Why we hold it</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To tell you whether we have room on the list near you.</li>
            <li>To arrange a first visit and quote the work.</li>
            <li>To keep a record of jobs done at your home, so the next visit picks up where the last left off.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Who sees it</h2>
          <p>Our own team, and &mdash; only when a job needs a licensed trade &mdash; the vetted specialist doing that particular work. We don&rsquo;t sell your details, and we don&rsquo;t pass them to marketplaces or advertisers.</p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>For as long as you&rsquo;re on our list, plus the period we&rsquo;re required to keep records for tax and insurance. Ask us to delete what isn&rsquo;t needed and we will.</p>

          <h2>Your say</h2>
          <p>You can ask to see what we hold, correct it, or have it removed. Write to <a href="mailto:hello@fettle.london">hello@fettle.london</a> and a person &mdash; not a bot &mdash; will sort it.</p>

          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="muted">Questions about any of this? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
